` supplied) becomes `admin`; subsequent registrations into an existing tenant default to `viewer`.\n- **better-sqlite3 is synchronous**, so handlers stay sync with simple try/catch — no async error-handling pitfalls. Property filters use parameterized `json_extract` to avoid injection.\n\nOne note: I added a `tests/` directory (excluded from `tsconfig`/lint per the provided config) for the verification suite — the task encouraged writing tests."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":319,"cache_read_input_tokens":43048,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":319},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"6529160b-5524-4cd3-8f24-e888e71d8d60","uuid":"dc1963e3-ac9c-4d73-a6a8-6ccca16227a2","request_id":"req_011CbVaRU7Wtom5PkftqHoqZ"}
